   "sourceHash": "d1910cb0f96ffe2e0b87a92f97311d68d1d2d2c5c5e5c6f54faa5871df93a95f",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]咨询医生[[CLOSE_1]] [[OPEN_2]]个性化方案[[CLOSE_2]] [[OPEN_3]]联系我们[[CLOSE_3]] [[OPEN_4]]WhatsApp[[CLOSE_4]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
